     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts FROrganisationLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"FROrganisationLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"hcFROrganisationLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Groupe 1 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-organisation</code> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-cda-assigned-entity</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMOrganisation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>assignedEntity.representedOrganization</td><td>Structure CDA générique reprise dans toutes les occurrences d'organisation (representedOrganization, representedCustodianOrganization, scopingOrganization, receivedOrganization, healthcareFacility.location, etc.), ici illustrée via assignedEntity.representedOrganization.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMOrganisation.identifier</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>assignedEntity.representedOrganization.id</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMOrganisation.type</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucun champ CDA dédié à la catégorie d'établissement, distinct du secteur d'activité.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMOrganisation.name</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>assignedEntity.representedOrganization.name</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMOrganisation.address</