t to</a></td><td>Organization.type (Kind of organization)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMOrganisation.name</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Organization.name (Name used for the organization)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMOrganisation.address</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Organization.address (An address for the organization)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMOrganisation.telecom</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Organization.telecom (A contact detail for the organization)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMOrganisation.partOf</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Organization.partOf (The organization of which this organization forms a part)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMOrganisation.industrySector</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>Organization.type (Kind of organization)</td><td>Organization.type est 0..* : type et industrySector y sont tous deux portés, avec des codifications différentes.</td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap FROrganisationLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"en-FROrganisationLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcFROrganisationLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-organisation</code> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-cda-assigned-entity</co